t $A,$ denoted $\\text{int}\\,A,$ is the set containing all the interior points of $A.$ It contains every point in $A$ except the boundary points: \n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A=A-∂A\n$$\n\nThe interior of $A$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/69/69708aa698c38f8a29d3eb69083f893fd8fca183bd713387456624fc38b86fe9.png)\n\nSo, in this case, the interior of $A$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{int}\\,A=\\{(x,y)\\in {R}^{2}\\,:\\,{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}<4,\\,0<x<2,\\text{ }0<y<2\\}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186193324 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186192787 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f89386f9-8a2b-56eb-8521-7c1ddafcfd96" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Interior of a Set"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "afb66ed2-895b-5f65-920c-57e9c4e712a3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0<y<2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379786} {:answer/id #uuid "c89a07de-de11-5729-9c3f-59a3dce504fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1\\le x\\le 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379787} {:answer/id #uuid "27aebc95-7034-501b-b146-69c5c61f0fd8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0\\le x\\le 1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379788} {:answer/id #uuid "f05d76fa-181c-5c72-bf35-0a16895ff797" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0<y<1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379789} {:answer/id #uuid "bca2f207-84e6-5811-b1b2-ec4c412cc4d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1<y<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379790}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bca2f207-84e6-5811-b1b2-ec4c412cc4d6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1<y<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186379790} :answer-field/id #uuid "0884985a-f4ec-5536-b90e-64a7f3d92f99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/i